1
00:00:00,844 --> 00:00:01,974
[DOOR OPENS]

2
00:00:02,263 --> 00:00:05,053
(Leonard (entering):)Hey, I just ran into Penny.
She seemed upset about something.

3
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:07,724
(Sheldon:)I think it's her time of the month.

4
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:12,565
(Sheldon:)I marked the calendar
for future reference.

5
00:00:15,734 --> 00:00:17,944
(Leonard:)What's with the fish?

6
00:00:18,112 --> 00:00:20,612
(Sheldon:)It's an experiment.

7
00:00:21,073 --> 00:00:24,413
- What happened to your egg research?
- Oh, that was a dead end.

8
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:27,667
(Sheldon:)Scrambled eggs are as good
as they're ever going to be.

9
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:31,000
So fish.

10
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:35,630
I read an article about scientists
who inserted DNA from luminous jellyfish...

11
00:00:35,796 --> 00:00:41,306
(Sheldon:)...into other animals, and I thought,
"Hey, fish nightlights."

12
00:00:43,345 --> 00:00:45,015
(Sheldon:)Fish nightlights.

13
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:48,270
It's a billion-dollar idea. Shhh!

14
00:00:49,101 --> 00:00:50,141
(Leonard:)Mum's the word.

15
00:00:51,854 --> 00:00:56,064
Are you sure you don't wanna just apologize
to Gablehauser and get your job back?

16
00:00:56,233 --> 00:01:00,023
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, no, no.
No, I have too much to do.

